# Files in this repo that must NOT be uploaded as public assets.
#
# Cloudflare Workers serves this repo's root directory. Anything here is
# fetchable at https://<site>/<path> by anyone who guesses the name — making
# the GitHub repo private does nothing about that.
#
# CLAUDE.md is the one that matters: it states in plain English that the
# business name and the prices are invented placeholders. A prospect finding
# that would be genuinely damaging.

CLAUDE.md
README.md
.gitignore
.nojekyll
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc

# outreach/ is gitignored so it never reaches Cloudflare at all. Listed here
# as a second line of defence in case that ever changes.
outreach/
